  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Sooner Or Later**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Engine Steam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-04-30.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 8 songs; 36 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording was very quiet, so the uploader boosted the volume; a loud pop near 2:40 in track 1 was reduced, and a cut at 16:48 was repaired [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper noted this Engine Steam was much quicker than the version played in Bloomington [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-04-30.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Taped by Low Dog from the audience; transferred from CD-R through EAC to FLAC level 8 [1]",
